maluos-desk (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First release (Phase 12 slice 6): `maluctl office enroll|status|heartbeat|
    leave` against the desk contract, surface 1 (docs/desk-enrolment.md): the
    desk token in the owner's vault compartment, /etc/maluos/office.yaml and
    office.env, the office's models as the gateway's `office` rung, presence
    heartbeats; the mock office for tests.

